  lines:
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: Again....
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: This...is worse than death....
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: Will this nightmare ever end?
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: What is wrong with you? You're a monster. Just let me DIE!!! PERMANENTLY!!!
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: The mighty Humberto Garcia Sauvignon, reduced to this...
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: "I don't wanna go back I don't wanna go back I don't wanna go ba\u2014"
